{
  "name": "Pstore: nightly pin health check",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "Pstore pin health check\n\nEvery night 09:30 UTC it logs into pstore (cookie auth) and pulls /api/pin-health?days=90 — the per-niche Pinterest attribution report — then alerts on Telegram when niches came up empty.\n\nSetup:\n1. Replace ADMIN_EMAIL_CHANGE_ME / ADMIN_PASSWORD_CHANGE_ME in the \"Login\" node with the pstore admin credentials.\n2. Create a bot with @BotFather, paste its token into the \"pstore alerts bot\" Telegram credential and set CHAT_ID in the alert node.\n3. Activate. Optional: add an EmailSend node in place of (or after) Telegram if you prefer email alerts.\n\nThe report splits every feed (published) niche into:\n- pinned_hits — a pin actually drove a click (healthy),\n- traffic_no_pin — the niche gets traffic but never attributed from pinterest,\n- published_silent — in the feed, zero clicks at all (probably not pinned yet).\nMisses are listed so you can re-pin or re-check the board."
      },
      "id": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000010",
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -520,
        -260
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "days",
              "daysInterval": 1,
              "triggerAtHour": 9,
              "triggerAtMinute": 30
            }
          ]
        }
      },
